1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,567
You finished the work.

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:03,167
But did you invoice it?

3
00:00:03,333 --> 00:00:05,333
Yeah. That part.

4
00:00:05,367 --> 00:00:07,467
Your brain has clocked out.

5
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:09,067
Your invoice hasn't.

6
00:00:09,167 --> 00:00:10,133
Wait.

7
00:00:10,167 --> 00:00:11,233
Say it instead.

8
00:00:11,333 --> 00:00:13,367
Open Invoice My Clients.

9
00:00:13,467 --> 00:00:15,500
Tell it what you did.

10
00:00:15,600 --> 00:00:17,633
It drafts the invoice.

11
00:00:17,667 --> 00:00:20,133
Review it. Confirm. Send.

12
00:00:20,167 --> 00:00:21,467
Then get back to your day.

13
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:22,900
Because you finished the work.
